              visible: Pv,
              highlighted: ["H","G","N","O"],
              justifications: [
                  { claim: "H : N = G : O", ref: "VII.Def.20" },
                  { claim: "alternately, H : G = N : O", ref: "VII.13" } ] },
            { text: "But {H} is to {G} as {A} is to {B}, therefore {A} is to {B} as is {N} is to {O}.",
              visible: Pv,
              highlighted: ["H","G","A","B","N","O"] },
            { text: "For the same reason {C} is to {D} as is {O} is to {M}.",
              visible: Pv,
              highlighted: ["C","D","O","M"] },
            { text: "Again, since {E} measures {M} the same number of times that {F} measures {P},",
              visible: Pv,
              highlighted: ["E","M","F","P"] },
            { text: "therefore {E} is to {F} as {M} is to {P}.",
              visible: Pv,
              highlighted: ["E","F","M","P"],
              justifications: [
                  { claim: "E : M = F : P", ref: "VII.Def.20" },
                  { claim: "alternately, E : F = M : P", ref: "VII.13" } ] },
            { text: "Therefore {N}, {O}, {M}, and {P} are continuously proportional",
              visible: Pv,
              highlighted: ["N","O","M","P"] },
            { text: "in the ratios of {A} to {B}, of {C} to {D}, and of {E} to {F}.",
              visible: Pv,
              highlighted: ["A","B","C","D","E","F"] },
            { text: "I say next that they are also the least that are in the ratios {A}, {B}, {C}, {D}, {E}, and {F}.",
              visible: Pv,
              highlighted: ["N","O","M","P"] },
            { text: "If not, there are numbers less than {N}, {O}, {M}, and {P}",
